OL,3,GNEWSABreath test for 'deadliest' cancer
OL,4,Atrialled in Wrexham
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 30-second breath test that could
OL,7,Fdetect pancreatic cancer is being
OL,8,Ftrialled in Wrexham.
OL,10,FPancreatic cancer is the deadliest
OL,11,Fcommon cancer, with half of people
OL,12,Fdying within just three months of their
OL,13,Fdiagnosis.
OL,15,FAbout 530 people are diagnosed with the
OL,16,Fdisease annually in Wales.
OL,18,FWrexham Maelor Hospital is part of a
OL,19,FUK-wide clinical trial involving more
OL,20,Fthan 6,000 patients with an unknown
OL,21,Fdiagnosis.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
